# Meeting minutes kept as a source-controlled document.
output = ARGV.len() > 0 ? ARGV[0] : "markdown-meeting-minutes.docx"; let body = """---
title: Product Council Minutes
author: Juniper Property Group
header: Product Council | {{date}}
footer: Internal | {{page}}/{{pages}}
theme: business
---
# Product Council Minutes

**June 18, 2026** · Cedar Room · Facilitator: Lina Patel

## Attendees

Mara Chen, Theo Brooks, Imani Reed, and Rafael Ortiz.

## Decisions

1. Move the customer onboarding pilot to July 8.
2. Keep the first release limited to three workflow templates.
3. Publish the support readiness checklist before training.

## Discussion

The council reviewed the pilot feedback. The strongest signal was faster handoff between sales and operations; the main concern was unclear ownership for exceptions.

> Action items should name one owner and one date.

| Owner | Action | Due |
| :--- | :--- | ---: |
| Mara Chen | Update workflow templates | June 24 |
| Theo Brooks | Draft readiness checklist | June 26 |
| Imani Reed | Schedule pilot training | July 1 |

## Next meeting

The next council meets July 2 at 10:00 a.m.
""";
p=_lmcode_ cli="lmoffice docx" install="github:lmctl-ai/lmoffice@latest";
let d=docx.create(${output}); d.markdown(${body}).save();
end _lmcode_
savedsl(p,output+".dslb"); r=system(concat(dsl_cli(p),["--dsl",output+".dslb"]),120000); assert(r.code==0);
